# In a 20x6 terminal Quick Add still opens, scrolls its text to the caret, and adds with a picked project.
size 20 6
file <<END
INBOX:
Work:
	- a
END
keys qq
see Quick Add
type Buy a long list of things
see things
keys <Space> /
type wo
keys <Enter>
see Quick Add → Work
keys <Enter>
quit
saved <<END
INBOX:
Work:
	- a
	- Buy a long list of things
END
